      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If you access this property on an event object that is not a mouse-tracking event — that is, its event type isn’t [`NSMouseEntered`](nsmouseentered.md), [`NSMouseExited`](nsmouseexited.md), or [`NSCursorUpdate`](nscursorupdate.md) —AppKit raises an [`internalInconsistencyException`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSExceptionName/internalInconsistencyException).",
      "normalizedSource": "If you access this property on an event object that is not a mouse-tracking event — that is, its event type isn’t [`NSMouseEntered`](nsmouseentered.md), [`NSMouseExited`](nsmouseexited.md), or [`NSCursorUpdate`](nscursorupdate.md) —AppKit raises an [`internalInconsistencyException`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSExceptionName/internalInconsistencyException).",
      "sourceHash": "acd9bc0f6872dfbb7f8d71901147406e9ff2376288a86f1738538db8db2322df",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
