      "contextBefore": "If you access this property on an event object that is not a mouse-tracking event — that is, its event type isn’t [`NSMouseEntered`](nsmouseentered.md), [`NSMouseExited`](nsmouseexited.md), or [`NSCursorUpdate`](nscursorupdate.md) —AppKit raises an [`internalInconsistencyException`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSExceptionName/internalInconsistencyException).",
